# Deny all direct web access to the test suite. TestRunner.php's fixture
# helper shell_exec()s `php -S ... &` and `kill` to stand up a throwaway PHP
# server for each test run; an anonymous HTTP request to this file makes the
# web server itself spawn and kill processes as www-data, and an aborted
# request orphans the listener. Must only ever be run from the CLI (php
# tests/TestRunner.php). Matches the house pattern used in
# /web/animMIDI/.htaccess.
Order allow,deny
Deny from all
